{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_6lwrvfwsiwa62ymtv77rkrprnyepm3fvuvzlvtueymfnrmis6pfq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01Ht8iXAn2QDKEGFbP2X5zQU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -f lib.rs.pristine && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport re\np='CONFIGS.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"## Checklist status\n\nAll 42 rows are exercised by `translation/tests/differential.rs`; see the test\nname mapping in that file's header comment. A row is checked off only after it\npassed across its randomized inputs against the C `.so`.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| 43 | `div_euclid` | **meta-row**: assert the boundary cross-product provably reaches all ten control paths (`v2==0` early return + L1..L9), so no leaf can be silently unexercised | [x] |\n\n## Checklist status\n\nAll 43 rows are exercised by `translation/tests/phase_b_configs.rs` (test names\n`cfg_row01_*` .. `cfg_row42_*` plus `cfg_meta_all_ten_control_paths_reached`);\nthe row -> test mapping is in that file's header comment. Every row was checked\noff only after it passed across its randomized inputs against the C `.so`.\n\n**Verified result: 43/43 rows pass**, under all 6 configurations\n(dev/release x default/`--no-default-features`/`--all-features`).\n\n### Leaf-coverage evidence\n\n`leaf_of(v1, v2)` in the test file re-implements the C ladder's branch selection\nindependently, and:\n\n* `cfg_meta_all_ten_control_paths_reached` asserts all ten paths are reached;\n* `cfg_row40_uniform_random_full_domain` asserts it ran all 4,000,000 iterations\n  *and* that each of the four bulk leaves (L1, L2, L4, L5) was hit > 500,000\n  times, so \"4 million random pairs\" cannot degenerate into one code path;\n* `cfg_row38_exhaustive_small_square` asserts exactly 1,050,625 comparisons;\n* `cfg_row41_single_axis_full_sweeps` asserts > 2,000,000 comparisons.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ngrep -c \"^| \" CONFIGS.md; grep -n \"43/43\" CONFIGS.md","description":"Update CONFIGS.md with verified results"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":119605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":897,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94ecab56-1cd7-404d-a102-e9551ae25aff","uuid":"33f3f36f-e1df-40b4-9866-133f38f7cff7","timestamp":"2026-08-26T20:55:11.232Z"}
